; Balanced virtual postings form their own balancing group, whose
; balance is checked with the same price inference as a real group's
; (since #3317): the bracketed pair below balances at the exchange
; rate the two amounts imply, $1 = 0.80 EUR, and the transaction is
; accepted.  Before #3317 the virtual group's balance was checked
; without implicit exchange, and the transaction was rejected.

2024/01/01 Bracketed exchange
    Assets:A    $100
    Assets:B    $-100
    [V:A]       $100
    [V:B]       -80 EUR

test bal
                   0  Assets
                $100    A
               $-100    B
                $100
             -80 EUR  V
                $100    A
             -80 EUR    B
--------------------
                $100
             -80 EUR
end test
